# Explainability

Example

RowErg Intervals are selected because your objective is to improve whole-body conditioning while limiting impact on the lower limbs.

The rowing stroke reinforces coordinated force production through the legs, trunk and upper body, qualities that transfer effectively to grappling and striking sports.

